    "NSSiriUsageDescription" : {
      "comment" : "Shown by iOS in the permission prompt when the app first asks for Siri access, directly under the system's own question. One short sentence saying what the app will do with Siri. Apple rejects vague or missing purpose strings, so keep it concrete. Siri is a product name and is never translated.",
